# Audit Screenshots

## Purpose
This directory stores visual evidence from:
- Lighthouse accessibility audits
- Keyboard-only navigation passes
- Architecture verification (monorepo skeleton, README boundaries)

## Structure
docs/audit/screenshots/
├── lighthouse-report.png
├── keyboard-navigation.gif
├── missing-alt.png
├── contrast-fail.png
├── no-skip-link.png
├── heading-issues.png
├── aria-misuse.png

## Usage
- Reference each screenshot in `audit-worksheet.md` under **Screenshot/Report Reference**.
- Keep filenames descriptive and consistent with the issue documented.
- Store raw Lighthouse JSON/HTML reports separately in `docs/audit/reports/`.

## Submission
Include this folder in your GitHub repository so reviewers can verify:
- Accessibility issues flagged
- Keyboard navigation behavior
- Architecture compliance
